# SATURATE (V4-T08): simulated lighting_cct sensors for spaces the coverage
# audit found uninstrumented. Every sensor is labeled ontosage:isSimulated.
# Rows live in the narrow table 'equipment_data' (database_registry.yaml key).
@prefix brick: <https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#> .
@prefix ref:   <https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick/ref#> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
